www/js/gemcad.js is a JavaScript port of LibGemcadFileReader, which reads the
GemCad .asc and .gem faceting-design formats. It is used under the MIT licence,
which is compatible with the Apache License 2.0. The port keeps its own MIT
header; that header, not this project's licence, governs that file.

