The page (www/studio.html, built from web/) ships the runtime of Svelte, a UI compiler
and library, inside its single inlined script. It is used under the MIT licence, which is
compatible with the Apache License 2.0.

    Svelte
    Copyright (c) 2016-2025 Svelte Contributors
    https://github.com/sveltejs/svelte
